# Normalise line endings. Development happens on Windows; the build and
# runtime are Linux. Storing LF in the repository keeps diffs clean and stops
# CRLF reaching shell scripts or CI runners.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets - never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
